OL,4,Aextinguisher discharge
OL,5,
OL,6,FFire Protection Recycling Limited was
OL,7,Ffined #40,000 over safety breaches and
OL,8,Fordered to pay #17,034 in costs at
OL,9,FBirmingham Magistrates' Court on
OL,10,FMonday.
